  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_FOLLOW_START1",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 29 03}喂，Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ追过来了！\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_FOLLOW_START2",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 2A 03}那只Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ，\n似乎把我们当成目标了。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
