  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_SENSOR2",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 2D 03}喂，确认有Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_SENSOR3",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 2E 03}这气息…是Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ？\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_FOLLOW_END1",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 2F 03}……嗯？Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ\n似乎不再追过来了。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_FOLLOW_END2",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 30 03}顺利甩掉Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ了。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_FOE_FOLLOW_END3",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 31 03}那只Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ放弃了吗……\n真是个没毅力的家伙。\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/dungeon/script/sanada_support.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "SANADA_PARTY_HPTP10_1",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 04 01 01 01 07 01 32 03}身体发沉啊……\n差不多该回去了吧？\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
